{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065319/block/singleImage/3275908/wm/01M84E42KSYB6QR0MM06NR9V1G.jpeg?updatedAt=1795445449\"/><figcaption>天璽．天本月暫錄得15宗租務成交，平均實用呎租約72元。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產啟德新區啟德 1 號分行經理施蒂文表示，啟德本月至今暫錄得 137 宗租賃成交，當中天璽．天佔 15 宗，平均實用呎租約 72 元，交投暢旺。 施蒂文指，中原最新促成一宗天璽．天 6 座中層 A5 室租賃成交，單位實用面積約 300 方呎，採一房間隔。單位坐向南方，望開揚車站廣場景，以 2.25 萬元租出，呎租約 75 元。 據悉，業主於 2024 年以 744.4 萬元購入單位，現享約 3.6 厘租金回報，回報不俗。 即睇啟德天璽．天租盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:43:55.687890+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:37:17.728786+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:37:20.513773+00:00","content_hash":"1df1eaf8a8d677734019840722e66c24d57ba087fe707215dd5f3565fc3f9b74","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:43:55.687890+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}